### Style.css light theme

```css
/* Light, clean, and readable theme for Robert Terupo CV */
/* Drop this in style.css and link it with: <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" /> */

:root {
  --bg: #f8fafc;        /* soft light background */
  --card: #ffffff;      /* white card */
  --text: #0f172a;      /* slate-900 */
  --muted: #475569;     /* slate-600 */
  --accent: #0ea5e9;    /* sky-500 */
  --border: #e5e7eb;    /* slate-200 */
  --tag-bg: #eef6ff;    /* light blue */
  --tag-text: #0b5cab;  /* deep blue */
  --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  --radius: 12px;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

html, body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, "Noto Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

a {
  color: var(--accent);
  text-decoration: none;
}
a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

/* Layout */
.container {
  max-width: 880px;
  margin: 2rem auto;
  padding: 0 1rem;
}

.card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  padding: 1.25rem;
}

/* Typography */
h1, h2, h3 {
  margin: 0.15rem 0 0.6rem;
  line-height: 1.25;
}
h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
h2 {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: var(--accent);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
  margin-top: 1.1rem;
}
h3 { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); }

p { margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }

/* Sections and items */
.section { margin-top: 1rem; }
.item { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }

/* Bullets with Noto emojis */
.emoji { margin-right: 0.55rem; }
.bullet {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.55rem;
  margin: 0.4rem 0;
}
.lead { font-weight: 600; }

/* Contact row */
.contact {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.8rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 0.4rem;
}
.contact span {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.35rem;
}

/* Tags (skills chips) */
.row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  margin: 0.25rem 0;
}
.tag {
  background: var(--tag-bg);
  color: var(--tag-text);
  border: 1px solid #dce9fb;
  padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
}

/* Divider (optional utility) */
.divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--border);
  margin: 0.8rem 0;
}

/* Simple top navigation (optional; add <nav> if you want) */
nav {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.8rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.8rem;
}
nav a {
  padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: var(--text);
  background: #ffffff;
}
nav a:hover {
  border-color: var(--accent);
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* Responsive tweaks */
@media (max-width: 520px) {
  .container { margin: 1rem auto; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .card { padding: 1rem; }
}

/* Print-friendly (so you can export a PDF nicely) */
@media print {
  body { background: #ffffff; }
  .card {
    box-shadow: none;
    border: 1px solid #dddddd;
  }
  a { color: #000000; text-decoration: none; }
}
```

